        "canvasHeightPx",
        "physicalWidthMm",
        "physicalHeightMm",
        "pxPerMm"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "What the editor was told about the chosen placement when the document was authored.\n\nThis is **document data, not authority**. Product Side and Embroidery Area rows remain the source of truth, and a later API compares these values with them; `APP3-P01` only proves the values are well-formed positive finite numbers, and `APP3-P02` owns every geometric consequence."
